Cell[TextData[{
 "The fits below approximate the value of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SuperscriptBox["d\[Phi]", "lm"], TraditionalForm]],
  FormatType->"TraditionalForm",ExpressionUUID->
  "dd1374c4-ae48-40f2-9ed9-f2a61f00ed46"],
 "/df at 6 collocation points in the intermediate region. For instance, d\
\[Phi]3[2,1,\[Eta]_,\[Chi]1_,\[Chi]2_] returns the value of  ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SuperscriptBox["d\[Phi]", "21"], TraditionalForm]],
  FormatType->"TraditionalForm",ExpressionUUID->
  "f70c9fe3-8dea-476c-8808-d83db1c457c4"],
 "/df at the 3rd collocation points. The frequencies of the collocation \
points are given in Tab VII. \nThese fits are implemented in ",
 StyleBox["LALSimIMRPhenomXHM_intermediate.c. ",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "E.g. IMRPhenomXHM_Inter_Phase_44_p6 would return",
 StyleBox["s ",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "the value of  ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SuperscriptBox["d\[Phi]", "44"], TraditionalForm]],
  FormatType->"TraditionalForm",ExpressionUUID->
  "2d11ec71-9861-4f6e-b8fb-bcc9ba9def32"],
 "/df at the 6th collocation point.  \n\nIn what follows, S=sTotR"
}], "Text",
