c5f446cea0c8"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "This fit returns the relative difference in phase  between 32 and 22 modes, \
see Eq. (6.10). The reference frequency at which both phases are evaluated is \
fring22. This function is implemented in ",
 StyleBox["IMRPhenomXHM_RD_Phase_32_SpheroidalPhaseShift",
  FontWeight->"Bold",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 StyleBox[".",
  FontSlant->"Italic"]
}], "Text",
